        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b6f7d058-c59b-40e2-bf9b-3a560a873391",
      "content": "Related Policies\n\nFor time off, consult the PTO and Leave Policy. For remote work, consult the Remote and Hybrid Work Policy. For acceptable technology use, consult the Acceptable Use Policy.",
